1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Every health app has a chatbot.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Nadi has a team.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,500
A team of AI agents

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,500
that think out loud before they advise you on health.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Four agents. One meeting.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Every time you ask a health question,

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
you watch the team deliberate.

8
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Before they advise you.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Fatima, 38, in Dubai.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Waking up tired after three pm.

11
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,500
Fasting glucose creeping up.

12
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,500
She types her message to Nadi.

13
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,500
Planner asks two clarifying questions.

14
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:52,000
How long, and anything stressful recently.

15
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,500
She answers inline.

16
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,500
Executor pulls her last six weeks of wearable data.

17
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:02,000
Every claim carries a citation.

18
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,500
Critic finds a gap: cortisol and thyroid.

19
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:09,000
It challenges Executor's first proposal.

20
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,500
Guardian runs the safety policy.

21
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,500
Nothing acute. No red line. Cleared.

22
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:19,000
Consensus: a fourteen-day morning-walk

23
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,500
and light-eating protocol.

24
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:25,500
Re-check fasting glucose in thirty days.

25
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:28,500
Confidence 74 percent. Six sources. Zero red flags.

26
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:32,000
The transcript is scrollable. Every claim has an evidence ID.

27
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Nothing here is a guess.

28
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,500
Ahmed, 46, in Abu Dhabi.

29
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:42,000
He's finished a course of medication.

30
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
He uploads a lab result. Asks for a plan.

31
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,500
Guardian reads the value. Slightly elevated.

32
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:52,000
Nadi does not diagnose. Does not prescribe.

33
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
It says: please see a clinician.

34
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,500
Nadi is a prototype.

35
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:02,000
Today we have four agents,

36
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,000
thirty adversarial safety tests,

37
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,000
and twenty-three curated knowledge entries.

38
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,500
Tomorrow we want a pilot partner in Dubai.

39
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:14,500
We're asking for mentorship,

40
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:17,000
the AED 550,000 grant,

41
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,000
and one health organisation willing to give us honest feedback.
